<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-044" chapter-id="c-jinshu-044-cuiyue" source-id="s-jinshu-044-cuiyue">
  <p id="c-jinshu-044-cuiyue:line074" annotation-status="pending" text-layer="received_chapter">悅字道儒，魏司空林曾孫，劉琨妻子之侄也。與諶俱為琨司空從事中郎，後為末波佐史。沒石氏，亦居大官。其綽、憲、暢並別有傳。</p>
</text>
